<title>LATVIA: LATVIA-BOURSE INDEX CLIMBS 0.91 PCT TO 391.67.</title>
<headline>LATVIA-BOURSE INDEX CLIMBS 0.91 PCT TO 391.67.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Latvian stock exchange index rose 0.9 percent on Friday to 391.67, the bourse said in a statement. </p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom +371 722 66 93</p>
